{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;In Banjiha&gt;</strong> is a first\u2011person single\u2011player horror game. <br>\u201cBanjiha\u201d is the Korean term for semi\u2011basement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version Info</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay lasts about 15 minutes (1/4 of the full game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience the beginning of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save files are not compatible with the full release.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a room of a semi\u2011basement apartment building.\u2028 <br>The door won\u2019t open.\u2028 <br>Explore the dark, damp space and find a way out of this house\u2014<i>no matter what.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with various objects to find ways to solve problems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.poster.avif?t=1760104819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.webm?t=1760104819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/5af7bab23d34c0ad2e88aeee9a110ffb.mp4?t=1760104819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the house.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.poster.avif?t=1760104819\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.webm?t=1760104819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/extras/307f68c4fcc3d19d76ed283926d207eb.mp4?t=1760104819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a linear story \u2014 focus on a single goal and move forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time for the full release is about 1 hour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream, record, and upload content featuring any part of this game (including the beginning, ending, and credits).\u2028 Monetization activities such as donations and ad revenue are also allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not required to credit the game, but we truly appreciate it if you do.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026980?t=1760104819","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/5a3bcc70a4b902956e248ae356f4a6c09dee4d7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760104819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/f6de76ff79f7fcc58fd6f029ac06ecb744b9f79f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760104819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026980/f6de76ff79f7fcc58fd6f029ac06ecb744b9f79f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760104819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":